sof24ncSEGFpXvtR3hGwx.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVW5pdGVkLUthY2NoZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.4","title":"Bus-king","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2023-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sajjad and Zareen need to pay their rent and inform Tango about it. Tango asks his shady roommate, Shampy for help and he has a plan. They get into trouble for busking at the Piccadilly circus.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q2PMf1qAgemdY8i7t1tam5bcgO2.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVW5pdGVkLUthY2NoZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.5","title":"Halloween Mubarak","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2023-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"It’s Halloween! Tango and his housemates plan a party. Daisy brings her friend Christina, who gets smitten by Tango. However he has other plans for the night.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fKevrgUON4fAyUQrmbeD3OGcVLo.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVW5pdGVkLUthY2NoZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.6","title":"Shaadi at the Strip","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2023-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Tango’s visa expires and now he is officially a Kaccha. When Daisy refuses to forgive him, he agrees to Shampy’s scheme – Fake Marriage. Will this scheme help or land him in a bigger mess?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xTaFw6JIan4TXivTzN3k1qiu6s4.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVW5pdGVkLUthY2NoZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.7","title":"Love Bite","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2023-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A new revelation has Tango angry and happy at the same time. He decides to focus on being happy and visits the bar. A drunk Tango returns home only to be bitten by a venomous spider.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pu2dJq4KVknYX2a9LbBT2dVq20W.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvVW5pdGVkLUthY2NoZS0lMjgyMDIzLS0lMjkv.1.8","title":"The Kaccha Heist","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2023-03-31T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Patel kicks the ‘kacchas’ out of the house and Tango tries to cheer them up. Shampy needs money for his mother’s operation, so the kacchas come together and plan a heist.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eIF8JsI8PoHKBsYtx9nYnotfVMC.jpg"}]}}